// Windows resource script for Virial.
// Bundles the multi-resolution .ico into the executable so the .exe
// shows the proper icon in the installer (Explorer copy dialog), on
// the desktop shortcut, in Alt-Tab and on the taskbar.
//
// The DPI-aware manifest is applied at runtime via
// `SetProcessDpiAwarenessContext` (see `platform::windows::desktop`)
// instead of being baked into the .exe resources: link.exe adds a
// default manifest of its own when no RT_MANIFEST resource is
// present, which means shipping one through winres duplicates the
// resource and CVTRES rejects the build with CVT1100.
//
// IDs:
//   1 = main application icon (PNG-encoded .ico with 16,24,32,48,64,128,256)
1 ICON "virial-gpui.ico"